</rdf:Bag></dc:creator>
<dc:description>We highlight the importance of magnetic reconnection at the heliopause, both as one of the key processes driving the interaction between solar and interstellar media, but also as an element of the definition of the heliopause itself.</dc:description>
<dc:subject><rdf:Bag><rdf:li>heliosphere</rdf:li><rdf:li>heliopause</rdf:li><rdf:li>heliosheath</rdf:li><rdf:li>solar wind</rdf:li><rdf:li>interstellar medium</rdf:li><rdf:li>magnetic reconnection</rdf:li><rdf:li>instrumentation</rdf:li></rdf:Bag></dc:subject>
